From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:52:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: enable the J120 video decoder

The J120 VXD decoded 720p H.264 and HEVC through V4L2 stateless requests. Each of 96 frames per codec matched software decoding.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts
index 7e210104a..f8131255b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts
@@ -295,3 +295,7 @@ &ps_pcie_aux {
 &ps_pcie_ref {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&vxd {
+	status = "okay";
+};
